    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i've been trying to force it a bit to save time so maybe that's the issue. i also noticed that the splintering seems more frequent when the grain is running at a weird angle through the pins. is there a specific way to orient the wood or should i be using a different type of chisel for those tricky spots?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
